Report at the project's issue tracker.
Include
.B "neutron doctor"
output, the device build fingerprint
.RB ( "getprop ro.build.fingerprint" ),
the kernel version
.RB ( "uname -srm" ),
and a minimal repro
\(em ideally a captured NDJSON segment that reproduces the issue.
Do
.B not
include personally identifiable data, app secrets, or device serial numbers
in the trace; redact before sharing.
